      "category": "ai",
      "title": "Vomit: Clean up Claude 5's token output with a separate LLM",
      "url": "https://github.com/zachahn/vomit",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49375996",
      "score": 189,
      "comments": 202,
      "author": "Bluestein",
      "published": "2026-08-20T15:26:02Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Uses secondary LLMs as post-processing filters to sanitize, compress, and format verbose token streams from high-capacity primary models.",
        "Decouples complex reasoning generation from final response formatting, preventing structural errors and prompt artifacts in downstream agents.",
        "Trades increased inference latency and compute cost for reduced context bloat in autonomous multi-turn LLM pipelines."
      ]
